OL,3,GNEWSADecision-makers not part of i360  
OL,4,Areview, council told                   
OL,6,FA report into lessons learned from     
OL,7,FBrighton and Hove City Council's #36m  
OL,8,Floan to the i360 did not consult the   
OL,9,Fcouncillors or officers involved in the
OL,10,Fdecision, a committee has been told.   
OL,12,FThe report, produced by the Chartered  
OL,13,FInstitute of Public Finance and        
OL,14,FAccountancy (CIPFA), was discussed at  
OL,15,Fan audit, standards and general        
OL,16,Fpurposes committee meeting on Tuesday. 
OL,18,FIn the report it said the council was  
OL,19,Fsold "over-ambitious" projections of   
OL,20,Fvisitor numbers, revenues and profits. 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
