OL,3,GNEWSADecision-makers not part of i360  
OL,4,Areview, council told                   
OL,6,FCommittee chair Pete West, who was a   
OL,7,Fmember of the council when it agreed to
OL,8,Fbroker the government loan, said: "No  
OL,9,Fkey decision-maker from the time was   
OL,10,Fconsulted and information in the public
OL,11,Fdomain was overlooked."                
